msgid ""
"This page covers how to make the physical connections between the autopilot,"
" RC receiver, ESC and servos as well as calibrating the RC transmitter, "
"Compass, Accelerometer, and ESC.  The following video covers making the "
"connections and setting up the transmitter to work with the autopilot."
msgstr ""
"本页面介绍如何在飞控、遥控接收机、ESC 和舵机之间进行物理连接，以及如何校准遥控发射机、罗盘、加速度计和 "
"ESC。以下视频介绍了如何进行连接及设置遥控器以配合飞控使用。"

