msgid "Autopilot Info"
msgstr "飞控信息"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-connecting-apm.rst:17
#: 2ad1e289102c48e5810b6b57847a2abd
msgid ""
"A autopilot with internally damped IMU's is highly recommended for "
"helicopters. Experience has shown the tuning, handling and stability "
"performance of your helicopter will be greatly improved over the first "
"generation autopilots, like the Pixhawk."
msgstr ""
"强烈推荐在直升机上使用具有内部减震 IMU 的飞控。经验表明，与第一代飞控（如 Pixhawk）相比，您的直升机的调参、操控和稳定性能将大大提升。"

