#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-connecting-apm.rst:24
#: 087104f0c80d41ceb45fc2291acad96d
msgid ""
"The RC input for many ardupilot compatible autopilots is either PPM SUM (8 "
"channels) or S.Bus (up to 18 channels).  Some controllers also accept "
"Spektrum satellite receivers.  For receivers that only output PWM, a PPM "
"encoder is required to connect to the autopilot, however this is not "
"recommended for applications requiring minimum possible latency.  For all "
"helicopter frames, an RC radio that has at least 6 channels is required.  "
"For autopilots, traditional helicopter and quadheli frames require one that "
"has at least 5 output channels. The dual helicopter frame requires the "
"autopilot have at least 7 output channels."
msgstr ""
"许多 ArduPilot 兼容飞控的遥控输入为 PPM SUM（8 通道）或 S.Bus（最多 18 通道）。一些控制器也接受 Spektrum "
"卫星接收机。对于只输出 PWM 的接收机，需要 PPM 编码器才能连接到飞控，但对于需要最小延迟的应用不推荐使用此方式。对于所有直升机机架，需要至少 6"
" 通道的遥控电台。对于飞控，传统直升机和四旋翼直升机机架需要至少 5 个输出通道。双旋翼直升机机架要求飞控至少有 7 个输出通道。"

