msgstr "电机控制"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-connecting-apm.rst:70
#: 0cd49442a6804090bdef68d5eeb7b03f
msgid ""
"The throttle servo or ESC for the main rotor motor is defaulted to output 8."
"  This is automatically configured as Heli RSC (servo function 31) for the "
"servo 8 function. See the :ref:`rotor speed control setup wiki <traditional-"
"helicopter-rsc-setup>` for more details on RSC setup.  All traditional "
"helicopter frames are required to use Motor Interlock.  This feature adds an"
" extra layer of safety when working with helicopters.  Motor interlock "
"enables the motor to drive the rotor/tailrotor.  This is similar to throttle"
" hold in RC helicopters.  Motor interlock enabled (throttle hold off) means "
"the motor is allowed to drive the rotor/tailrotor and the rotor speed "
"control handles the rotor runup/shutdown.  Motor interlock disabled "
"(throttle hold on) means the motor is not allowed to drive the "
"rotor/tailrotor.  In order to arm the helicopter, the motor interlock must "
"be disabled (throttle hold on). In ArduCopter 3.6 and earlier, the motor "
"interlock and RC passthrough mode is tied to RC channel 8 only.  The RC "
"transmitter channel 8 must have the PWM within 10 pwm of the RC8_MIN for "
"motor interlock disabled (throttle hold on).  All other PWM values will set "
"motor interlock enabled (throttle hold off).  In ArduCopter 4.0, the "
"RCn_Option parameter can be set to motor interlock for a user selectable "
"channel.  The transmitter channel on which the motor interlock is set "
"requires the PWM to be low (<1200 PWM) for motor interlock disabled "
"(throttle hold on) and above 1200 PWM for motor interlock enabled (throttle "
"hold off)."
msgstr ""
"主旋翼电机的油门舵机或 ESC 默认接输出 8。这将自动配置为舵机 8 功能的 Heli RSC（舵机功能 31）。有关 RSC 设置的更多详情，请参见"
" :ref:`旋翼转速控制设置 wiki <traditional-helicopter-rsc-"
"setup>`。所有传统直升机机架都需要使用电机联锁。此功能为直升机操作提供额外的安全保障。电机联锁使电机能够驱动旋翼/尾旋翼。这类似于遥控直升机中的油门锁定。电机联锁启用（油门锁定关）意味着电机被允许驱动旋翼/尾旋翼，旋翼转速控制负责旋翼的启动/关闭。电机联锁禁用（油门锁定开）意味着电机不被允许驱动旋翼/尾旋翼。为了解锁直升机，必须禁用电机联锁（油门锁定开）。在"
" ArduCopter 3.6 及更早版本中，电机联锁和遥控直通模式仅与遥控通道 8 关联。遥控发射机通道 8 的 PWM 必须在 RC8_MIN 的 "
"10 pwm 以内才能禁用电机联锁（油门锁定开）。所有其他 PWM 值将启用电机联锁（油门锁定关）。在 ArduCopter 4.0 "
"中，RCn_Option 参数可设置为电机联锁，用于用户可选择的通道。设置了电机联锁的发射机通道要求 PWM 为低值（<1200 "
"PWM）时禁用电机联锁（油门锁定开），高于 1200 PWM 时启用电机联锁（油门锁定关）。"

